  "contentHtml": "\n \n <div><!--IMG1--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/76899460.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s76899460.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG1--><br>Halloween-н баяраар мэдээж амттангүй байна гэвэл онцгүй шүү дээ. Монголчууд хэрхэн яаж тэмдэглэдэг гэдгийг сайн мэдэхгүй юм. Гэхдээ ихэнх улсад энэхүү баярыг өргөн тэмдэглэдэг болохоороо ч тэр юм уу янз бүрийн аймшигтай дүрстэй амттангуудаар ширээгээ чимэглэсэн байдаг. Зарим хүмүүст санаа оноо өгөх үүднээс зургуудыг та бүхэнд хүргэж байна. Halloween-н баяраа сайхан өнгөрүүлээрэй.<br><div><br><!--IMG2--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/39940362.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s39940362.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG2--><br>Бөөрөлзгөнө болон үрсэн шокладтай өт<br><br><!--IMG3--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/15125193.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s15125193.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/84065860.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s84065860.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--><br>HOT DOG мумми<br><br><!--IMG5--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/23138270.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s23138270.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG5--><br>Цөцгийтэй хэрэглэсэн бохир чих ухагч<br><br><!--IMG6--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/00113506.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s00113506.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG6--><br>Бөөлжиж буй хулуу<br><br><!--IMG7--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/64213247.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s64213247.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG7--><br>Муурын ялгадасан бялуу<br><br><!--IMG8--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/88698527.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s88698527.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG8--><br><!--IMG9--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/51142608.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s51142608.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG9--><br>Шулмын хуруун жигнэмэг<br><br><!--IMG10--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/04162074.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s04162074.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG10--><br>Мушигарсан гэдсэн бялуу <br><br><!--IMG11--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/75944548.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s75944548.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG11--><br>Баас (Жигнэмэг)<br><br><!--IMG12--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/60705024.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s60705024.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG12--><br>Зомбины тархи<br><br><!--IMG13--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/35988184.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s35988184.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG13--><br><!--IMG14--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/24450757.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s24450757.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG14--><br>Могойн бялуу<br><br><!--IMG15--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/44986815.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s44986815.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG15--><br>Цустай шархны наалтан жигнэмэг<br><br><!--IMG16--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/79047826.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s79047826.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG16--><br>Тарвасаар хийсэн араг яс<br><br><!--IMG17--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/71073493.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG17--><br>Нялх хүүхдийн хөл гартай шөл<br><br><!--IMG18--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/18157202.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s18157202.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG18--><br>Крем бяслагтай чавган хорхой<br><br><!--IMG19--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/09038870.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s09038870.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG19--><br>Жэлло зүрх<br><br><!--IMG20--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/33272574.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s33272574.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG20--><br>Турк бялуу<br><br><!--IMG21--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/27988844.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s27988844.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG21--><br>Halloween-н шарсан хавирга<br><br><!--IMG22--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/67313148.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131104104438im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/44/s67313148.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG22--><br>Махан гар<br></div></div>\n \n \n \n \n \n ",
  "contentText": "Halloween-н баяраар мэдээж амттангүй байна гэвэл онцгүй шүү дээ. Монголчууд хэрхэн яаж тэмдэглэдэг гэдгийг сайн мэдэхгүй юм. Гэхдээ ихэнх улсад энэхүү баярыг өргөн тэмдэглэдэг болохоороо ч тэр юм уу янз бүрийн аймшигтай дүрстэй амттангуудаар ширээгээ чимэглэсэн байдаг. Зарим хүмүүст санаа оноо өгөх үүднээс зургуудыг та бүхэнд хүргэж байна. Halloween-н баяраа сайхан өнгөрүүлээрэй.Бөөрөлзгөнө болон үрсэн шокладтай өтHOT DOG муммиЦөцгийтэй хэрэглэсэн бохир чих ухагчБөөлжиж буй хулууМуурын ялгадасан бялууШулмын хуруун жигнэмэгМушигарсан гэдсэн бялуу Баас (Жигнэмэг)Зомбины тархиМогойн бялууЦустай шархны наалтан жигнэмэгТарвасаар хийсэн араг ясНялх хүүхдийн хөл гартай шөлКрем бяслагтай чавган хорхойЖэлло зүрхТурк бялууHalloween-н шарсан хавиргаМахан гар",
